        "analysisD": "Incorrect. This is the exponential growth equation (J-shaped curve).",
        "referenceNote": "Syllabus reference: Unit-8 > Species and Population Ecology: population growth curves\nAt N = K/2, growth rate is maximum. Population regulation involves density-dependent factors.",
